# Games package rules

- One folder per game: `games/<slug>/`. Slug matches `games/registry.ts`.
- Client React entry owns the WebGL canvas and game loop. Hub chrome stays off `/play/[slug]`.
- Import `three` from npm. No cdnjs. No `document.write` of a full document.
- Subscribe to live gifts via `EventSource('/api/v1/games/<slug>/live')`.
- Document controls and F-key / gift actions in that game’s `README.md`.
- When adding a game, follow `docs/adding-a-game.md` and the `add-gamehub-game` skill.
